* Title: SystemVerilog Assertions 1.5 day course
* Version: 5.1
* Modified: 15 September 2022
* Description:
SystemVerilog Assertions Language Course
Course requires Xcelium, Indago and Jasper  
Solutions are in a directory named solutions 
The course requires the software Xcelium(or INCISIVE if Xcelium is not available), INDAGO and JasperGold.
These labs were tested on Xcelium 22.03-s006, INDAGO_MAIN 22.03.001-s and Jasper 2022.06-p002 64 bits.

There is a class_setup script which gets automatically sourced in the Cadence managed AWS environment
There is a example_onsite_class_setup file which shows examples of the the bare minimum env settings to
get the tool working, given that the $PATHs where the software is installed are not known in advance.
You will need to change the PATHs to match your installation

Developer: Michael Avery
